-- הסכם ההשלמה (29.2.2012) — העותק של משרד החינוך, עם מכתב הלוואי: a
-- second copy of the completion agreement of 29.2.2012, which the corpus
-- publishes beside the registered copy the agreement is encoded from
-- (`2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`, "the primary"). This
-- is the copy the Treasury's wages division sent the Ministry of Education's
-- accountant on the day of signing, with a covering letter. It is the same
-- agreement, row for row, except:
--   - the covering letter in front of it (29.2.2012, file שכ. 2012-8666),
--     which asks the Ministry to pay an advance, as soon as it can, to the
--     first deputies owed salary differences under §56 or §63 of the
--     agreement, and to prepare to carry out the rest of it;
--   - no registration stamp: the primary carries the Registrar's of
--     18.11.2013, this copy was sent the day it was signed;
--   - a few words: "עובדי ההוראה" for "עובדי הוראה" in two recitals, "המשא
--     המתן" for "המשא ומתן" in a third, a full stop for a semicolon; dashes
--     printed otherwise in many clauses; the formula of §67 (as §46
--     replaces it) written the other way round; and the illegible words the
--     corpus reads in the examples of §§26, 29, 34 and 46, which fall in
--     other places in the two copies — none of which changes a rule;
--   - §43(ב)'s (ג2) printed as one paragraph, which the primary prints as two;
--   - the union's name under its signature.
-- So each row the two share is cited "as in the primary", by the rule that
-- encodes it there; what this file encodes is the covering letter, which
-- imports the primary for the agreement it encloses and the two sections it
-- names.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`

§ `הסכם ההשלמה — 29.2.2012 (העותק של משרד החינוך, עם מכתב הלוואי)`

-- akn:preamble/p1 as in the primary, `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama` (its preamble/p1, a note: The document's title), printed here above the covering letter.

§§ `מכתב הלוואי — אגף השכר והסכמי עבודה, 29.2.2012`

-- The letterhead (p2–p4: מדינת ישראל, משרד האוצר, אגף השכר והסכמי עבודה)
-- and the signature (p16–p18: Kobi Bar-Natan, the senior deputy to the
-- wages commissioner): the letter is the wages commissioner's division's.
-- The footer (p22–p23) is the Treasury's address and web pages.
@ref akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p15 akn:preamble/p16 akn:preamble/p17 akn:preamble/p18 akn:preamble/p22 akn:preamble/p23
`the covering letter is from` MEANS `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`

-- The date, in the Hebrew calendar and in the civil one: ו' באדר התשע"ב,
-- 29 February 2012 — the day the agreement it encloses was signed.
@ref akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6
`the covering letter is dated` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 29 2 2012

#ASSERT `the covering letter is dated` EQUALS `the signing of the completion agreement`

-- The letter's file number. The agreement it encloses is filed under
-- another, שכ. 2012-8755 (its sign-off, below).
@ref akn:preamble/p7
`the covering letter's file number` MEANS "2012-8666"

-- akn:preamble/p8 The "תיק:" (file) line, left empty; no rule.

-- To Mr Yehuda Kaiser, the Ministry of Education's accountant, who pays the
-- Ministry's teachers; copies to the Ministry's manager and coordinator of
-- teachers' salaries (p19–p21).
@ref akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p19 akn:preamble/p20 akn:preamble/p21
`the covering letter is to` MEANS `the Ministry of Education`

-- The subject: "תשלום מקדמה לסגני מנהלים ראשונים בהתאם להסכם הקיבוצי מיום
-- 29.2.2012". The body: a signed copy of the agreement is enclosed; the
-- accountant is asked to pay an advance, as soon as possible, to the deputy
-- principals entitled to salary differences under §56 of the agreement
-- ("תיקון סעיף 92 להסכם הכולל — טבלאות השכר המשולב לסגני מנהלים ראשונים")
-- and/or under §63 ("תיקון סעיף 98 להסכם הכולל - שיבוץ בטבלת השכר המשולב
-- לסגנים ראשונים קיימים") — the titles the primary prints for its §§56 and
-- 63; and to prepare to carry out the agreement's other provisions as soon
-- as possible. "בהקדם האפשרי" sets no day (convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:preamble/p12 akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14
DECLARE `covering letter action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the advance on the first deputies' differences`
    `prepare to carry out the rest of the completion agreement`

-- §56: from 1.3.2011 the first deputies' table is 85% of the principals',
-- not 75% (imported). A month on or after that day paid at a smaller share
-- is a month §56 owes differences for.
GIVEN `month paid` IS A DATE, `share it was paid at` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§56 owes differences for the month` `month paid` `share it was paid at` IF
    `the first deputies' share of the principals' table on` `month paid` GREATER THAN `share it was paid at`

-- §63(ב)–(ד): an existing first deputy is placed on the 85% table (annex
-- י"ח) from 1.3.2011, in the cell parallel to his cell on the 75% table
-- (annex י"ח1), retroactively for one who moved in תשס"ח–תשע"א (imported).
-- A month on or after that day paid on the 75% table is a month §63 owes
-- differences for.
GIVEN `month paid` IS A DATE, `paid on the 75% table` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§63 owes differences for the month` `month paid` `paid on the 75% table` IF
        `month paid` `is on or after` `an existing first deputy's placement on the 85% table starts`
    AND `paid on the 75% table`

-- "ו/או": owed under either is enough.
GIVEN `owed under §56` IS A BOOLEAN, `owed under §63` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a first deputy the letter asks the advance for` `owed under §56` `owed under §63` IF
    `owed under §56` OR `owed under §63`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `covering letter action`
DECIDE `paying the first deputies' advance` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `pay the advance on the first deputies' differences`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `covering letter action`
DECIDE `preparing to carry out the rest of the completion agreement` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `prepare to carry out the rest of the completion agreement`

#ASSERT `§56 owes differences for the month` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011) (75%)
#ASSERT NOT `§56 owes differences for the month` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 2011) (75%)
#ASSERT `§63 owes differences for the month` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `§63 owes differences for the month` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011) TRUE
#ASSERT `a first deputy the letter asks the advance for` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `a first deputy the letter asks the advance for` FALSE FALSE

§§ `ההסכם — העותק שצורף למכתב`

